Local performance notes
=======================

Automatic NVIDIA GPU detection (USE="native cuda")
--------------------------------------------------

When USE="native cuda" is enabled, this ebuild automatically probes the local
NVIDIA GPU(s) in pkg_setup() (which runs as root, outside Portage's build
sandbox, avoiding /dev/nvidia* video-group permission failures) and persists
the normalized CMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES into src_configure().

Detection order:
  1. nvidia-smi --query-gpu=name,compute_cap --format=csv,noheader,nounits
     (also initializes /dev/nvidia-uvm and /dev/nvidia-modeset)
  2. /opt/cuda/bin/__nvcc_device_query
  3. /proc/driver/nvidia/gpus/*/information (world-readable procfs fallback)
  4. Portable CUDA architecture set (graceful fallback on headless/binpkg hosts)

Blackwell SM 12x targets (e.g. RTX 5070 Ti compute_cap 12.0) are automatically
promoted to architecture-accelerated native SASS (120a-real) for FP4 Tensor
Core instructions with zero PTX JIT overhead.

Optional overrides
------------------

  LLAMA_CPP_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES (or standard Gentoo/CMake CUDAARCHS):
    auto          Force auto-detection (fail if no GPU is found).
    12.0          Compute capability -> 120a-real.
    8.9           Compute capability -> 89-real.
    sm_120        Converted to 120a-real.
    120a-real     Passed to CMake directly.
    8.9;12.0      Multiple GPUs -> 89-real;120a-real.
    all           Build all architectures supported by the installed CUDA toolkit.

  LLAMA_CPP_CUDA_FA_QUANTS (default: "all"):
    FlashAttention K-V quantization combinations compiled into CUDA kernels.

  LLAMA_CPP_CUDA_COMPRESSION_MODE (default: "speed" with USE="native", else "size"):
    CUDA >= 12.8 fatbin compression mode: none, speed, balance, size.

Example /etc/portage/package.env:

  sci-ml/llama-cpp llama-cpp-perf

Example /etc/portage/env/llama-cpp-perf:

  LLAMA_CPP_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES="12.0"
  LLAMA_CPP_CUDA_COMPRESSION_MODE="none"

During configure, verify the log shows:

  CUDA configuration: CMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES=120a-real
  CUDA configuration: GGML_CUDA_FA_QUANTS=all, GGML_CUDA_COMPRESSION_MODE=speed
